{"id":522,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"世界と地域をつなぐ国際教育の立川国際","feature_description":"立川国際中等教育学校は「Think Globally, Act Locally」を掲げ、国際社会で活躍するリーダーを育てる教育目標を示しています。前期課程から英語や国際理解、探究活動を組み合わせ、異なる文化や言語を持つ生徒が学び合う環境を整えています。学校案内では前期課程の給食や後期課程の昼食方法も案内し、6年間のカリキュラムを通した学びを紹介しています。","clubs":[{"id":14630,"name":"サッカー（前期・後期）部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/tachikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14631,"name":"男子バスケットボール（前期・後期）部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/tachikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14632,"name":"女子バスケットボール（前期・後期）部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/tachikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14633,"name":"硬式テニス（前期・後期）部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/tachikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14634,"name":"軟式野球（前期・後期）部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/tachikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14635,"name":"バドミントン（前期・後期）部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/tachikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14636,"name":"剣道（前期・後期）部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/tachikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14637,"name":"陸上競技（前期・後期）部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/tachikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14638,"name":"ラクロス（前期・後期）部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/tachikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14639,"name":"卓球（前期・後期）部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro.ed.jp/tachikawa-s/school_life/activities.html","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14640,"name":"男子バレーボール（前期・後期）部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.metro